('apple-airpods-max-2-977430','Apple AirPods Max 2','Apple','beeld-geluid','Audio voor onderweg','Noise cancelling koptelefoons',NULL,'Middernacht','Geniet ongestoord van je favoriete muziek met Apple AirPods Max 2 Middernacht. Deze koptelefoon dempt storend omgevingsgeluid via noise cancelling. Zo hoor jij ook in een drukke trein of op een rumoerig kantoor je muziek of podcast nog goed. Dankzij de H2 chip klinkt geluid helder. Als je een filmpje kijkt op je iPhone of iPad, klink geluid ook echt ruimtelijk. Een auto die van links naar rechts over het scherm voorbij scheurt, hoor je ook eerst links en dan rechts. Via gespreksdetectie herkennen je AirPods Max 2 wanneer je tegen iemand begint te praten. Je geluid gaat dan automatisch zachter, zodat je het gesprek goed volgt. Als je belt met AirPods Max 2, klinken stemmen altijd helder, dankzij stemisolatie. De batterij gaat 20 uur mee.','["Over ear","20 uur accuduur","Noise cancelling"]'::jsonb,'[{"title":"Product","specs":[["Fabrikantcode","MHWK4ZM/A"],["Merk","Apple"],["Afhandeling van je defect","Via Coolblue"],["Oude apparaat gratis retour","Ja"]]},{"title":"Fysieke eigenschappen","specs":[["Gewicht in gram","384,8 g"],["Kleur","Zwart"],["Materiaal","Metaal"],["Ingebouwde microfoon","Ja"]]},{"title":"Klank volgens specialist","specs":[["Getest door specialist","Ja"],["Hoge tonen","Een beetje in balans"],["Middelhoge tonen","In balans"],["Lage tonen","In balans"],["Equalizer","Nee"]]},{"title":"Geluid","specs":[["Geluidsweergave","Spatial audio, Stereo"],["Hi-res audio","Ja"],["Volumebegrenzing","Nee"],["Actieve hoofdtelefoon","Ja"],["Noise cancelling","Ja"],["Kwaliteit noise cancelling","Topklasse"]]},{"title":"Verbinding","specs":[["NFC","Nee"],["Bluetooth","Ja"],["Bluetooth-versie","5.0"],["Multipoint pairing","Ja"],["Compatibel met spraakassistent","Siri"]]},{"title":"Kabel","specs":[["Kabel los te koppelen","Nee"],["Platte kabel","Nee"],["Krulsnoer","Nee"],["Gevlochten huls","Nee"],["Afstandsbediening in kabel","Nee"]]},{"title":"Kwaliteit","specs":[["Geluidskwaliteit volgens klanten","Zeer goed"],["Draagcomfort volgens klanten","Onder gemiddeld"]]},{"title":"Stroomvoorziening","specs":[["Type stroomvoorziening","Accu / batterij"],["Gemiddelde accuduur","20 uur"]]},{"title":"Bestendigheid","specs":[["Waterbestendig","Nee"]]},{"title":"Behuizing","specs":[["Type oorkussen","Over ear"],["Type klankkasten","Gesloten"],["Opvouwbaar","Nee"],["Draaibare oorschelpen","Ja"],["Materiaal oorkussens","Stof"],["Fysieke knoppen oorschelp","Ja"],["Touchpad oorschelp","Nee"],["Afstandsbediening op oorschelpen","Ja"],["Volume regelaar oorschelp","Ja"]]}]'::jsonb,'469.00','579.00','401514823','["401514823","1053473754","936856804","1212964260","1672655405","1785277295","702401984","1425275613","1409127907","1162109496"]'::jsonb,'[{"title":"Kleur","type":"color","values":["Blauw","Sterrenlicht","Oranje","Paars","Middernacht"]}]'::jsonb,'[{"sku":"977430","name":"Apple AirPods Max 2 Middernacht","values":{"Kleur":"Middernacht"},"price":"469.00","listPrice":"579.00","imageIds":["401514823","1053473754","936856804","1212964260","1672655405","1785277295","702401984","1425275613","1409127907","1162109496"]},{"sku":"977432","name":"Apple AirPods Max 2 Blauw","values":{"Kleur":"Blauw"},"price":"469.00","listPrice":"579.00","imageIds":["159477738","1532538556","70036627","778117866","1263664850","2093824166","516671639","286107394","195006470"],"specs":[["Fabrikantcode","MHWM4ZM/A"],["Kleur","Blauw"]]},{"sku":"977431","name":"Apple AirPods Max 2 Sterrenlicht","values":{"Kleur":"Sterrenlicht"},"price":"469.00","listPrice":"579.00","imageIds":["1015233425","353362325","38716807","250339941","840416798","613057700","1287006957","208645644","1069576532"],"specs":[["Fabrikantcode","MHWL4ZM/A"],["Kleur","Goud"]]},{"sku":"977433","name":"Apple AirPods Max 2 Oranje","values":{"Kleur":"Oranje"},"price":"419.00","listPrice":"509.00","imageIds":["1709843465","1601477296","774548144","878860773","1329631626","